  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rescue 10 Million Meals with RLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As of March 2022, global food prices have reached an all-time high. Over the course of the pandemic, the number of food insecure households in the U.S. has increased from 10 million households in 2020 to 14 million households in 2022. Help RLC prevent wasted food by rescuing and redistributing surplus meals to the people who need them most. Now is the time to spread our mission further across the United States!</narrative>
  </description>
